/// Remove ramdrive.device unit zero and return its DOS device name.
///
/// This historical entry point performs `KillRAD(0)`: it removes the reset
/// recovery hooks, frees the RAD disk memory, and returns the colon-terminated,
/// null-terminated DOS device name that had been associated with unit zero.
///
/// # Returns
///
/// A pointer to the device-name string, such as `RAD:`, or null when the unit
